  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FONDATION FORUM DE BAMAKO 2024: Bamako Forum</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FONDATION FORUM DE BAMAKO 2024: Bamako Forum</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forum Bamako is a yearly event with the purpose to analyse, disseminate and debate new research finding and methods to address Mali&apos;s peace and security challenges.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Forum Bamako &#xe4;r ett &#xe5;rligt evenemang syftar till att analysera, debattera och publicera nya forskningsr&#xf6;n och metoder f&#xf6;r att hantera Malis freds-och s&#xe4;kerhetssproblem.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this intervention is to promote analysis, dissemination, dialogue and debate based on research findings relating to the theme: Culture, Reconciliation, Peace and Development. Furthermore, the Forum will provide an opportunity to share experiences and lessons learnt in Africa and elsewhere in the world with regard into the chosen theme. It will provide up to date information and allow for the sharing of best practices among decision makers and practitioners, with a focus on actors in West Africa. 

The themes for the panel debates of the 2024 edition are (approximately translated from French):
1. Civilizations and modern states in West Africa
2. Culture, inter community conflicts and violence
3 African and national identifies and the future
4. Culture production and the economy
5. Education and culture
6. Cultural diplomacy
7. Financing cultural public policy
8. Technological revolution, culture and art</narrative>
  </description>
